(7233085, 1118531, 48710, '<td valign="top">Pastoral scenes can be a challenge. Find some interesting stopping place for the eye. This shot has it: the unusual fence posting. Not something I''ve seen every day, or any day, come to think of it.</td>', 'Pastoral scenes can be a challenge. Find some interesting stopping place for the eye. This shot has it: the unusual fence posting. Not something I''ve seen every day, or any day, come to think of it.', '2014-06-25 10:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
