(7233999, 1118319, 60173, '<td valign="top">Who let you off the island??<br/> <br/>Love the image. I like how the colors are almost muted and then PAZOW... bright orange flowers. The combination of the muted colors and the bright "look at me!" colors distracts from the fact that there''s cars on the bridge. I didn''t even think to look for cars for a couple minutes when looking at it. The square crop was an excellent choice that really accents the composition.</td>', 'Who let you off the island?? Love the image. I like how the colors are almost muted and then PAZOW... bright orange flowers. The combination of the muted colors and the bright "look at me!" colors distracts from the fact that there''s cars on the bridge. I didn''t even think to look for cars for a couple minutes when looking at it. The square crop was an excellent choice that really accents the composition.', '2014-06-27 13:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
